    "description": "Led a cross-functional Agile team of 10+ engineers delivering enterprise-scale insurance applications, overseeing the full software development lifecycle from planning through production support. Modernized legacy applications by upgrading Java and Spring Boot versions, improving maintainability, compatibility, and long-term platform stability. Designed, developed, and maintained Spring Boot REST APIs and cloud-based backend services supporting scalable, fault-tolerant production systems. Built and supported CI/CD pipelines using AWS CodePipeline, Docker, EC2, and Git-based workflows to automate builds, testing, deployments, and environment consistency. Implemented containerization with Docker to improve deployment reliability and ensure parity across development, QA, and production environments. Helped drive a strategic shift from product-based delivery to feature-based execution across 8 concurrent product builds, reducing projected delivery timelines from approximately 8 months to 1.5 months. Improved deployment consistency and reduced production incidents through automated release processes, standardized artifact promotion, and enhanced operational workflows. Collaborated closely with developers, QA teams, product owners, and leadership to deliver high-impact enterprise features in fast-paced Agile environments.",
